<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Friday show that net currency reserves fell to about 101.4 billion marks in the week ending July 15 from about 102.0 billion marks in the week ending July 7.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    July 15	 July 7</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     117.3	   117.9</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.9	    15.9</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
